-- ============================================================
-- LoadingScreen
-- Purpose  : Production-ready loading screen with:
--            - custom loading camera
--            - progress bar
--            - click / tap / press-to-start after 100%
--            - loading music only during loading
--            - GameTheme released only after start input
--            - safe camera, audio, blur, control and UI cleanup
--
-- Runs on  : Client, ideally inside ReplicatedFirst
--
-- Expected setup:
-- ReplicatedFirst
--   LoadingSystem
--     LoadingScreenGui
--       Frame
--         ProgressBarContainer
--           ProgressBar
--           ProgressText
--         AfterLoading
--           ClickButton
--           Information
--             UIStroke
--     LoadingCameraCFrame
--
-- LoadingCameraCFrame must be a CFrameValue.
--
-- Optional:
-- StarterGui.LoadingScreenGui fallback
-- ReplicatedStorage.PreloadAssets
-- Workspace.LoadingViewPart legacy fallback only
-- SoundService.GameTheme
-- SoundService.MainTheme legacy fallback
-- Workspace.MainTheme legacy fallback
-- ============================================================

